out={'schema':'research.sec_issuer_continuity_adjudicator_r2','workload_id':'SEC_ISSUER_CONTINUITY_ADJUDICATOR_R2','parent_context':'P287','claim':'Determine whether P287 remaining XOM coverage failure is a current ticker-to-CIK corporate-identity transition rather than absent SEC filed-at history. Do not require a retired predecessor CIK to keep advertising the successor ticker.','company_tickers_xom_rows':xom,'current_mapping_ciks':mapped,'current_mapped_entity':current,'legacy_long_history_entity':legacy,'tests':{'legacy_has_pre2012_through_2026_facts':longhist,'current_mapped_cik_is_2026_recent':recent,'current_successor_reports_XOM':successor_xom,'legacy_has_25_NSE_exit_filing':exit_form,'entity_name_continuity':names,'fact_chronology_nonoverlap':chronology,'current_company_tickers_contains_recent_cik':CURRENT_CIK in mapped},'decision':'SEC_XOM_CIK_TRANSITION_CONFIRMED__LINEAGE_LAYER_REQUIRED' if ok else 'SEC_XOM_CIK_TRANSITION_NOT_CONFIRMED','decision_rule':'Confirm only if predecessor has long history through 2026, successor begins in 2026 and carries XOM, predecessor has 25-NSE exit evidence, Exxon Mobil identity is continuous, and predecessor facts end no later than successor facts begin.','scientific_consequence':'If confirmed, preserve SEC companyfacts source feasibility but require deterministic corporate-action/issuer-lineage authority before historical cross-sectional alpha inference. Do not drop XOM, union CIKs ad hoc, or use current ticker mapping as historical membership authority.','r1_correction':'R1 circularly required both predecessor and successor submission records to simultaneously report XOM. R2 uses exit-form, name-continuity, successor-ticker, and nonoverlapping fact chronology evidence instead.','boundaries':{'scientific_authority':True,'portfolio_ranking':False,'allocation_authority':False,'runtime':False,'broker':False,'live_trading':False}}
